<title>USA: Richmond Fed Broaddus sees tight labor mkt in '97.</title>
<headline>Richmond Fed Broaddus sees tight labor mkt in '97.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Reserve Bank of Richmond President Alfred Broaddus said he expects U.S. labor markets to remain tight in 1997 and said the forces keeping U.S. inflation subdued might be temporary.</p>
</text>
